  "body": "Think living in Takapuna is beyond your budget? This might just change your mind.\r\n\r\nHere's your opportunity to enjoy the Takapuna lifestyle in a beautifully presented, low-maintenance brick-and-tile home that has plenty more to offer than first meets the eye.\r\n\r\nStep inside and you'll discover polished timber floors, light-filled living and a stylish modern kitchen featuring stone benchtops, quality appliances and soft-close cabinetry.\r\n\r\nBut there's more.\r\n\r\nThe living area flows straight onto a generous, sunny private deck - ideal for entertaining friends, weekend BBQs or simply enjoying your own outdoor retreat.\r\n\r\nHere's what you'll love:\r\n\r\nTwo genuine double bedrooms\r\n\r\nModern kitchen with stone benchtops\r\n\r\nUpdated bathroom\r\n\r\nBeautiful polished timber floors\r\n\r\nDouble-glazed aluminium joinery\r\n\r\nLow-maintenance brick-and-tile construction\r\n\r\nSunny, private outdoor entertaining deck\r\n\r\nTwo off-street car parks\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location.\r\n\r\nTakapuna Beach, cafés, restaurants, shopping and public transport are all within easy reach, while motorway access makes commuting particularly convenient.\r\n\r\nDon't judge this home by its street address - come inside and discover what you're missing.\r\n\r\nWith off-street parking available, viewing is easy.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, busy professional or downsizer wanting to enjoy the Takapuna lifestyle, this home is well worth your attention.\r\n\r\nFor Sale by Negotiation\r\n\r\nPlease be aware that this information has been sourced from third parties. View our property information disclaimer here: raineandhorne.co.nz/property-disclaimer",
